    "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Case 1: <math><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />i.e., <math><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math> , then<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0&#160;</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1&#160;</mn></math><math><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Case 2: <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />i.e., <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />&nbsp;<br />Hence, domain is <math><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
